<section class="section"><div class="wrap" style="max-width:760px">
  <span class="eyebrow blue">Legal</span><h1>Privacy policy</h1>
  <p class="lede">Replace this page with a policy drafted for your jurisdiction.</p>
  <p>The platform stores: account identity details supplied at registration, session records including IP address and user agent, and a full transaction ledger. Your final policy should state the lawful basis for each, the retention period, any third-party processors (your host, your payment providers, TradingView for charting), and how a client requests export or deletion.</p>
</div></section>
